## 11.2 先实现 CP，再实现 Tucker

CP forward：

# $$  
u_n

\sum_{r=1}^{R}  
\lambda_r  
\prod_{m=1}^{M}  
f^{(m)}_r(\xi_{m,n}).  
$$

代码逻辑：

```python
factors = []
for m in range(M):
    Fm = factor_m(x_m)  # [batch, R]
    factors.append(Fm)

prod = torch.ones(batch, R)
for Fm in factors:
    prod = prod * Fm

y_hat = (prod * lambda_r).sum(dim=-1)
```

Tucker forward 可以先用 `torch.einsum`：

```python
y_hat = torch.einsum('abc,ba,bb,bc->b', G, F1, F2, F3)
```

注意实际 einsum 索引要避开重复命名，例如：

```python
y_hat = torch.einsum('ijk,bi,bj,bk->b', G, F1, F2, F3)
```

